 "name_en": "SAP Fiori Analytical Apps for Contract Accounting Manager (2KH)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>SAP Fiori Analytical Apps for Contract Accounting Manager (2KH)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc4a06d6b540049a0ae5b58d11827f999\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc4a06d6b540049a0ae5b58d11827f999__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item lets you analyze data in Convergent Contract Accounting (FI-CAC) according to different business perspectives.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc4a06d6b540049a0ae5b58d11827f999__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze overdue items</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze open credits</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze write-offs</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze clearing reasons</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze payment run exceptions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze returns</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create worklists to perform checks and resolve problems</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Track status of worklist processing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc4a06d6b540049a0ae5b58d11827f999__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze Contract Accounts Payable and Receivable in one Fiori app</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>面向合同会计经理的 SAP Fiori 分析应用 (2KH)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc4a06d6b540049a0ae5b58d11827f999\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc4a06d6b540049a0ae5b58d11827f999__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目允许您根据不同的业务角度分析集中合同会计 (FI-CAC) 中的数据。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc4a06d6b540049a0ae5b58d11827f999__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">分析逾期项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析未清贷项</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析注销</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析清算原因</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析付款运行异常</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析退货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建工作清单以执行检查并解决问题</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">跟踪工作清单处理的状态</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc4a06d6b540049a0ae5b58d11827f999__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在一个 Fiori 应用中分析合同科目应付账款和应收账款</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
